   "title": "Square A",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&A^2=\\begin{bmatrix}3&4\\\\7&6\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3&4\\\\7&6\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}37&36\\\\63&64\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
