   "title": "Check",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&(2,1):\\ 63=7(9)\\ \\checkmark,\\quad (2,2):\\ 64-10=54=6(9)\\ \\checkmark\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Shortcut for 2 $\\times$ 2: A\\^{}2 $-$ (trace)A +}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{|A|I = O, with trace 9 and |A| = $-$10.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
